  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One route, every direction",
      "items": [
        "Every move is PATCH {id} with {\"status\": \"<value>\"} \u2014 ChangeStatus assigns any of the four values unconditionally",
        "There is no dedicated freeze/close endpoint, and no ordering between the four states \u2014 any status may be set from any other"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Only one guard, on the target",
      "items": [
        "The single check is on entering Closed: refused (ACCOUNT_HOLDS_BALANCE) whenever Balance or HeldAmount is non-zero, whatever the current status",
        "Status gates postings too: Frozen refuses every direction including a reversal; Dormant refuses a debit (including a debiting reversal) \u2014 see Postings' Record/Reverse flow for AccountPostingPolicy.StatusGate"
      ]
    }
  ]
